{
  "file_id": "3546",
  "text_count": 227,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������*sigh* I got a Crest, but...",
      "_offset": 2390,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uf... Tengo un Emblema, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "We have no clue how to use it.",
      "_offset": 2427,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No tenemos ni idea de usarlo."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Or how to \"raise them properly...\"",
      "_offset": 2458,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "O cómo \"criarlos bien\"..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "But we still haven't found all the\nEmblemas yet.",
      "_offset": 2493,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Aún no hemos encontrado todos\nlos Emblemas."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Let's wait until all of us have a\nCrest so that we can try and\nfigure this out.",
      "_offset": 2540,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Esperemos a que todos tengamos\nun Emblema para intentar\naveriguar esto."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Gryaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 2628,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Groaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "W-what's that?!",
      "_offset": 2649,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Q-qué es eso?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "It's Kuwagamon!",
      "_offset": 2665,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es Kuwagamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 2681,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Watch out, Agumon!",
      "_offset": 2689,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Cuidado, Agumon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "What should I do, Tai?",
      "_offset": 2708,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué hago, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "What should you...aaaagh!",
      "_offset": 2734,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tú deberías...aaaagh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Agumon! Evolve! You need to\nevolve!",
      "_offset": 2760,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Agumon, evoluciona!\nDebes hacerlo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "But what if that doesn't work?\nWhat if he turns into something\nother than Greymon...?",
      "_offset": 2796,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Pero y si no funciona?\nY si se convierte en algo\ndistinto a Greymon...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Gshhhaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 2882,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Gshhhaaaaaaaah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Come on, what are you doing?",
      "_offset": 2899,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vamos, qué estás haciendo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "We're done fooooor!",
      "_offset": 2928,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Estamos perdidooos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Pit Bomb!",
      "_offset": 2948,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Bomba!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "W-what just happened?",
      "_offset": 2958,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Q-qué acaba de pasar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Kuwagamon...",
      "_offset": 2980,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Kuwagamon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Pi! You scrubs!",
      "_offset": 2993,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Pi! Novatos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "...? Are you talking to me?",
      "_offset": 3009,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "...? Me hablas a mí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Are you okay, Tai?",
      "_offset": 3037,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Estás bien, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "What's this...weird thing?",
      "_offset": 3059,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué es esta cosa rara?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Aaaaah! You're Piccolomon!",
      "_offset": 3086,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Aaaaah! Eres Piccolomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "So cuuute!",
      "_offset": 3113,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué monoo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Piccolomon defeated Kuwagamon!",
      "_offset": 3124,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Piccolomon venció a Kuwagamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Pi, pi, pi. Did you see the power\nof my magic?",
      "_offset": 3155,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Pi, pi, pi. Habéis visto el poder\nde mi magia?"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Huh...",
      "_offset": 3202,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "You're the Chosen Children, aren't\nyou? That was a really close call,\nit was painful to watch, pi!",
      "_offset": 3209,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Sois los Niños Elegidos, no?\nMenudo susto habéis pasado,\ndaba pena miraros, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Those Emblemas and Circuitos are just\nwasted on you, pi!",
      "_offset": 3308,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Emblemas y Circuitos\nno valen en vosotros, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "This Digimon isn't cute at all.",
      "_offset": 3358,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Este Digimon no es nada mono."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "You Digimon are slacking off as\nwell, pi! You lack exertion and\nguts, pi!",
      "_offset": 3390,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vosotros Digimon también\nestáis vagos, pi! Falta\nesfuerzo y agallas, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "I haaaaaate exerting myself!",
      "_offset": 3464,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Odiooo esforzarme!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "That's why, starting today, all of\nyou will be training under me, pi!",
      "_offset": 3493,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Por eso, a partir de hoy,\ntodos entrenaréis conmigo, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Training?",
      "_offset": 3563,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Entrenar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Especially the two of you over\nthere!",
      "_offset": 3573,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Sobre todo vosotros dos de\nahí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Me?",
      "_offset": 3611,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Yo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Me?",
      "_offset": 3615,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Yo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "You two are severely afflicted,\npi! You'll be getting the super\nspecial training course, pi!",
      "_offset": 3619,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vosotros dos estáis fatal,\npi! Tendréis el curso especial\nde entrenamiento súper, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Okay, let's go, pi!",
      "_offset": 3712,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale, vamos, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "What should we do?",
      "_offset": 3732,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué hacemos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "What kind of Digimon is he?",
      "_offset": 3751,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué tipo de Digimon es?"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "He's fussy, but he's not a bad\nDigimon.",
      "_offset": 3779,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es quisquilloso pero no\nes mal Digimon."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Doesn't seem to have a black gear,\neither.",
      "_offset": 3819,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tampoco parece tener una rueda\nnegra."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "What should we do, Tai?",
      "_offset": 3862,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué hacemos, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Hm, why not?",
      "_offset": 3889,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Por qué no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Well then, it's decided!",
      "_offset": 3902,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Bueno, pues decidido!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "What are you doing? Hurry up and\nget over here, pi!",
      "_offset": 3927,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué hacéis? Daos prisa y\nvenid aquí, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Okaaaaaaay...",
      "_offset": 3979,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Valeeeeee..."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "That's my training camp, pi!",
      "_offset": 3993,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ese es mi campamento, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "We have to climb all the way up\n*there*?",
      "_offset": 4022,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tenemos que subir hasta\nahí arriba?"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "You know, Etemon is chasing us.",
      "_offset": 4063,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Etemon nos está persiguiendo."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "We shouldn't be hanging around in\none place for too long.",
      "_offset": 4095,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No deberíamos quedarnos\nen un sitio tanto tiempo."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "No need to worry, pi! My barrier\ncan't be seen from the outside,\npi!",
      "_offset": 4153,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No os preocupéis, pi! Mi\nbarrera no se ve desde\nfuera, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Are you sure we'll be okay?",
      "_offset": 4222,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Seguro que estaremos bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "We'll just have to believe him for\nnow.",
      "_offset": 4250,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Por ahora solo nos queda\nconfiar en él."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Are we really gonna have to climb\nthat? No way...",
      "_offset": 4290,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "En serio hay que subir\neso? Ni de coña..."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Don't give up, Mimi!",
      "_offset": 4340,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No te rindas, Mimi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "*pant, pant*",
      "_offset": 4361,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "(jadeos)"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "*pant, pant*",
      "_offset": 4374,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "(jadeos)"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "You sound tired, Mimi...",
      "_offset": 4391,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Suenas cansada, Mimi..."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "You should be ashamed of being\nexhausted so easily, pi!",
      "_offset": 4416,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Deberías avergonzarte de\ncansarte tan rápido, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "The first part of your training is\nto scrub this floor!",
      "_offset": 4472,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "La primera parte de tu\nentrenamiento es fregar esto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "S-scrub...?",
      "_offset": 4528,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "F-fregar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "No waaaaaay!",
      "_offset": 4540,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué vaaaa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "You two severely afflicted ones\nget the special menu! Tell me when\nyou're ready!",
      "_offset": 4553,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vosotros dos, los más graves,\ntenéis menú especial! Decidme\ncuando estéis listos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Got it.",
      "_offset": 4634,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Ready? Let's start the training.",
      "_offset": 4642,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Listos? Empecemos el entreno."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Are we gonna be okay...?",
      "_offset": 4675,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Estaremos bien...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Hang in there, Tai!",
      "_offset": 4700,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Aguanta, Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "You'll be fine, Agumon!",
      "_offset": 4723,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Estarás bien, Agumon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Aaah, it's completely dark.",
      "_offset": 4747,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Aaah, está todo oscuro."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "What are we supposed to be doing\nin this cave? We can't see a\nthing.",
      "_offset": 4775,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué se supone que hagamos\nen esta cueva? No vemos\nnada."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "At the back of this cave, there's\nsomething important you need to\nrecover. That's the training, pi!",
      "_offset": 4844,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Al fondo de esta cueva hay\nalgo importante que debéis\nrecuperar. Es el entreno, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Something important?",
      "_offset": 4944,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Algo importante?"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "That's it? Explain a little\nbetter!",
      "_offset": 4965,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eso es todo? Explica\nun poco mejor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Go look for it. That's your\ntraining!",
      "_offset": 5001,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ve a buscarlo. Ese es tu\nentreno!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Piccolomon's not giving us any\ntraining, just a bunch of\nconfusing riddles!",
      "_offset": 5039,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Piccolomon no nos da entreno,\nsolo un montón de acertijos\nconfusos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Is this one of those things we're\nsupposed to be figuring out once\nwe get there?",
      "_offset": 5115,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es una de esas cosas que hay\nque averiguar cuando lleguemos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Well, we don't have any other\nchoice but to try, so let's go.",
      "_offset": 5196,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Bueno, no tenemos más remedio\nque intentarlo, así que vamos."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Tai, look!",
      "_offset": 5258,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tai, mira!"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "A treasure chest! This must be\nwhat Piccolomon was talking about!",
      "_offset": 5272,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Un cofre del tesoro! Debe ser\nde lo que hablaba Piccolomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "I wonder what's inside.",
      "_offset": 5338,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué habrá dentro..."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "He said it was something\nimportant, but it doesn't look\nlike much from here.",
      "_offset": 5362,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Dijo que era algo importante,\npero desde aquí no parece\ngran cosa."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Aaaah!",
      "_offset": 5439,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Aaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "What's happening?! My feet are\nsinking into the ground!",
      "_offset": 5446,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué pasa?! Mis pies se están\nhundiendo en el suelo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Taiiiiii!!",
      "_offset": 5502,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Taiiiiii!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Agumooooooon!",
      "_offset": 5516,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Agumooooooon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Zzz...",
      "_offset": 5530,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Zzz..."
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Zzz... Zzz...",
      "_offset": 5537,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Zzz... Zzz..."
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Izzy, have you seen Tai?",
      "_offset": 5551,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Izzy, has visto a Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "No, Tai and Agumon haven't\nreturned.",
      "_offset": 5584,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No, Tai y Agumon no han\nvuelto."
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "I wonder if they're okay...",
      "_offset": 5624,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Espero que estén bien..."
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "I'm worried...",
      "_offset": 5652,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Me preocupa..."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "My Tag is glowing.",
      "_offset": 5673,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Mi Circuito brilla"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Mine is, too!",
      "_offset": 5692,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El mío igual!"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Our Emblemas must be nearby!",
      "_offset": 5706,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Nuestros Emblemas cerca!"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Let's go find them!",
      "_offset": 5733,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vamos a buscarlos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 5753,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Where ya goin', guys?",
      "_offset": 5759,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "A dónde vais?"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "You're not gonna leave without us,\nare you?",
      "_offset": 5781,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No nos dejaréis atrás,\nverdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Gabumon!",
      "_offset": 5825,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Gabumon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "You weren't sleeping either,\nTentomon?",
      "_offset": 5834,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tampoco dormías,\nTentomon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Got woken up by your Tag all\nshinin'.",
      "_offset": 5873,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Me despertó tu Circuito\nbrillando."
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "You're gonna go find the Emblemas,\nright? Take us with you!",
      "_offset": 5911,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vais a buscar los Emblemas,\nno? Llevadnos con vosotros!"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Okay.",
      "_offset": 5969,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale."
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "We'll go look for them. It should\nbe easier if the four of us\ncombine our efforts.",
      "_offset": 5975,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Iremos a buscarlos. Será\nmás fácil si los cuatro\nunimos fuerzas."
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "When you consider where the Tag\nstarted shining from, it should be\nsomewhere in this direction.",
      "_offset": 6058,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si pensamos por dónde empezó\na brillar el Circuito, debería\nestar por esta dirección."
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "My Tag started shining there too.",
      "_offset": 6154,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Mi Circuito también brilló ahí."
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "So, why don't we go on a little\njungle expedition?",
      "_offset": 6188,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Por qué no hacemos\nuna expedición a la jungla?"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Yes!",
      "_offset": 6239,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Still, I wonder why both our Circuitos\nreacted at the same time?",
      "_offset": 6244,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Por qué reaccionaron los dos\nCircuitos a la vez?"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "I think I know why.",
      "_offset": 6304,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Creo que sé por qué"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Just focus on finding the Emblemas.",
      "_offset": 6324,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Solo pensad en los Emblemas."
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "The Emblemas fell together when they\nwere scattered around the\ncontinent.",
      "_offset": 6358,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Los Emblemas cayeron juntos\ncuando se dispersaron por\nel continente."
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "I see. It makes sense when you put\nit that way.",
      "_offset": 6430,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ya veo. Tiene sentido visto\nasí."
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Y-you're right...I'm sorry for\nasking such a strange thing.",
      "_offset": 6478,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "T-tienes razón... Perdón por\npreguntar algo tan raro."
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "Ah! That's...",
      "_offset": 6538,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ah! Eso..."
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "The portal of light Piccolomon\nmade when we came here.",
      "_offset": 6552,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El portal de luz que hizo\nPiccolomon para venir aquí."
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "Seems like we've arrived at the\nother side of the barrier.",
      "_offset": 6607,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Parece que llegamos al otro\nlado de la barrera."
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "But the Circuitos are reactin' to\nsomething right ahead of us.",
      "_offset": 6666,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Pero los Circuitos reaccionan\na algo justo delante."
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "What should we do?",
      "_offset": 6724,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué hacemos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "We've come this far, so let's keep\ngoing!",
      "_offset": 6743,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Hemos llegado hasta aquí,\nsigamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "You're right!",
      "_offset": 6785,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tienes razón!"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "We're back in the desert.",
      "_offset": 6799,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Volvemos al desierto."
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "Matt! That well over there! The\nTag is reacting!",
      "_offset": 6825,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Matt! Ese pozo de ahí! El\nCircuito reacciona!"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "You're right!",
      "_offset": 6876,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tienes razón!"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "The walls of the well are shining.",
      "_offset": 6890,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Las paredes del pozo brillan."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "Let's try climbing down and\nholding out our Circuitos.",
      "_offset": 6925,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Probemos a bajar y sacar\nnuestros Circuitos."
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "Are we gonna be okay, Matt?",
      "_offset": 6975,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Estaremos bien, Matt?"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "Don't worry about it!",
      "_offset": 7005,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No te preocupes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "Lord Etemon! We've confirmed a\nreaction at Area K1!",
      "_offset": 7027,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Señor Etemon! Confirmamos una\nreacción en Área K1!"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "Good job! Area K1\nis...Tyrannomon's territory!",
      "_offset": 7079,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Bien hecho! Área K1\nes territorio Tyrannomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "All right, I'll show the Chosen\nChildren a pretty little sight for\nthe eyes!",
      "_offset": 7126,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Bien, les daré a los Niños\nElegidos un bonito espectáculo\npara la vista!"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "Look! It's our Emblemas!",
      "_offset": 7203,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Mira, los Emblemas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "Aaaaah! You did it, Matt!",
      "_offset": 7226,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Aaaaah! Lo lograste, Matt!"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "You ain't no slouch either,\nIzzy!",
      "_offset": 7254,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tú tampoco eres manco,\nIzzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "Yes! Now we have five Emblemas.",
      "_offset": 7293,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Sí! Ya tenemos cinco Emblemas"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "What's that?",
      "_offset": 7326,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué es eso?"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "Gghhaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 7339,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Gghhaaaaaaaah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 7355,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Aaaaaaaaah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "Ruuuuun!!",
      "_offset": 7368,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Corred!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Hey, did you hear?",
      "_offset": 7378,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Oye, te enteraste?"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "You mean Matt, Izzy, \nGabumon and Tentomon? Apparently\nthey left to go find their Emblemas.",
      "_offset": 7397,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Te refieres a Matt, Izzy,\nGabumon y Tentomon? Parece que\nse fueron a buscar sus Emblemas"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Awww...after all that training,\nI'd rather go hunt down some\nEmblemas too...",
      "_offset": 7494,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Uy... después de tanto entreno,\nprefiero ir a buscar\nEmblemas también..."
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "Mimi...",
      "_offset": 7569,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Mimi..."
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "Hey!",
      "_offset": 7577,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Oye!"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "Gyah!",
      "_offset": 7582,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ay!"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "Don't get distracted by the\nothers!",
      "_offset": 7588,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No te distraigas con los\ndemás!"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "That's easy to say, but...",
      "_offset": 7624,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Fácil decirlo, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "I wonder if Matt and Izzy\nare okay...",
      "_offset": 7651,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Espero que Matt e Izzy\nestén bien..."
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "!! The barrier's been broken, pi!",
      "_offset": 7696,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "!! La barrera se ha roto, pi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 7730,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "Matt and Izzy are in\ndanger!",
      "_offset": 7737,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Matt e Izzy están en\npeligro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "You can't just *say* that without\nwarning!",
      "_offset": 7773,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No puedes \"decir\" eso sin\navisar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "Hurry, we've got to rescue them!",
      "_offset": 7816,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Rápido, hay que rescatarlos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "Tai! Hey, Tai, wake up!",
      "_offset": 7849,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tai! Oye, Tai, despierta!"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "Mm...mmm...where are we?",
      "_offset": 7879,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Mmm...dónde estamos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "I don't know. We were in that\ncave...",
      "_offset": 7904,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No lo sé. Estábamos en esa\ncueva..."
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "The boat's drifting away.",
      "_offset": 7942,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "El barco se aleja."
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "I wonder where we're going...",
      "_offset": 7968,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "A dónde iremos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "Hm? What's that?",
      "_offset": 8002,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eh? Qué es eso?"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "english": "Looks like a huge bridge.",
      "_offset": 8019,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Parece un puente enorme."
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "english": "I've...seen this bridge before.",
      "_offset": 8045,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ya... he visto este puente."
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "english": "Gaaah!",
      "_offset": 8077,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Aaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "english": "What's he doing?",
      "_offset": 8084,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué hace él?"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "english": "Dunno. Maybe trying to ride a\nbicycle?",
      "_offset": 8101,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ni idea. Quizá intenta montar\nen bici?"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "english": "A bi-cy-cle?",
      "_offset": 8140,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Una bi-ci?"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "english": "It's a sort of vehicle. Ah!",
      "_offset": 8153,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es una especie de vehículo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "english": "What's wrong?",
      "_offset": 8181,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Qué pasa?"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "english": "T-that's me!",
      "_offset": 8195,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ese soy yo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "english": "Huh? That's you, Tai?",
      "_offset": 8208,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eh? Ese eres tú, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "english": "I can't...I can't ride a bike...",
      "_offset": 8233,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No puedo...no puedo montar..."
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "english": "Don't give up!",
      "_offset": 8266,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No te rindas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "english": "! Who's...",
      "_offset": 8281,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Quién...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "english": "You can't just give up after only\na few tries! Believe in yourself! \nYou'll get it right this time!",
      "_offset": 8292,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No puedes rendirte tras solo\nunos intentos! Cree en ti!\nEsta vez lo conseguirás!"
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "english": "Okay...okay. Thank you, mister.",
      "_offset": 8392,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vale...vale. Gracias, señor."
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "english": "That's what I forgot, Agumon. That\nI shouldn't get discouraged.",
      "_offset": 8424,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Eso es lo que olvidé, Agumon.\nQue no debía desanimarme."
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "english": "Me, too. That's why I couldn't\nbecome Greymon.",
      "_offset": 8488,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Yo también. Por eso no\npude ser Greymon."
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "english": "I was afraid you'd turn into\nanother awful Digimon, so I\nchickened out.",
      "_offset": 8535,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tenía miedo de que\nconvirtieras en otro Digimon\nhorrible, y me acobardé."
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "english": "If we combine our powers, I think\nI'll be able to evolve again!",
      "_offset": 8607,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Si combinamos nuestro poder,\npodré digievolucionar otra vez!"
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "english": "Mattoooooooo!!",
      "_offset": 8671,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Mattoooooooo!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "english": "Everyone! You came to save us!",
      "_offset": 8688,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Chicos! Venís a salvarnos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "english": "Are you okay?",
      "_offset": 8719,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Estáis bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "english": "It's showtime!",
      "_offset": 8733,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Es la hora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "english": "Etemon!",
      "_offset": 8748,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Etemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "english": "Now that you're all together in\none place, I'll take you out!",
      "_offset": 8756,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ahora que estáis todos juntos\nen un sitio, os eliminaré!"
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "english": "Let's go! Love Serenade!",
      "_offset": 8821,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Vamos! Serenata de Amor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "english": "No!",
      "_offset": 8846,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No!"
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "english": "I've lost my power...",
      "_offset": 8850,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Perdí mi poder..."
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "english": "Now! Tyrannomon!",
      "_offset": 8872,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Ya! Tyrannomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "english": "*Gghhaaaaaaaah!!*",
      "_offset": 8889,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Gghhaaaaaaaah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "english": "We can't wait for Tai and\nAgumon, pi! I don't like it, but\nI have to stop Tyrannomon myself.",
      "_offset": 8907,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "No podemos esperar a Tai\ny Agumon, pi! No me gusta,\npero debo parar a Tyrannomon."
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "english": "Guyyyyys!",
      "_offset": 9003,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Chicooos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 9013,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "english": "Good job on returning, Chosen\nChild!",
      "_offset": 9021,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Bien hecho al volver,\nNiño Elegido!"
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "english": "Take 'em all out at once! Go,\nTyrannomon!",
      "_offset": 9058,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Acábalos a todos!\nVamos, Tyrannomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "english": "Agumon, evolve!",
      "_offset": 9100,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Evoluciona!"
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 9116,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": "Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "english": "Ghiiiii! You annoying brats!\nIkghii!!",
      "_offset": 9122,
